From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: neko-legends <neko-legends@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 15:00:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] deepseek_v41: four DGX Sparks on G19 (TP=4, pipelined prompts, review fixes, vLLM metrics)

The four-Spark layer of this fork, on jayleaton's G19 (patches 0001/0002,
engine 7bd2d67): what 0003-0006 were on G13, merged onto G19, plus the
N-rank ports of G16-G19 features that assumed two ranks (fail-fast over
one fate channel per follower, the memory floor on the tightest
follower, the plan link (rdma stays two-rank; tcp with the rank
handshake at four), image segments kept out of the prompt pipeline, the
vision budget on rank 0 alone).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
